{"step_index":5576,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-23T18:59:33Z","thinking":"Initial hypothesis: The request is for a visual representation of a process. This could be a static diagram or an interactive, evolving illustration. Evaluating the best format to convey the dynamic nature of a design or process flow. Considering Mermaid as a concise, easily interpretable option.\n\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    A[Start: Shortage Item Ingested] --> B{Warehouse Candidate Available?};\n    B -- Yes --> C{Category 1-7 Match?};\n    B -- No --> D[Move to: \"لم يُعثر عليه\" (Not Found)];\n    C -- Yes --> E{Confirmed Match Conditions Met?};\n    C -- No --> F{Check Further Attributes};\n    F -- Match Found --> E\n    F -- No Match --> G{Review Required?};\n    E -- Yes --> H[Move to: \"مطابقة مؤكدة\" (Confirmed Match)];\n    E -- No --> I[Move to: \"يحتاج مراجعة\" (Review)];\n    G -- Yes --> I\n    G -- No --> D\n\n    style A fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    style B fill:#ccf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    style C fill:#ccf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    style D fill:#fcc,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    style E fill:#ccf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    style F fill:#ccf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    style G fill:#ccf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    style H fill:#9f9,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    style I fill:#ffc,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n```\n\nThe initial step involves checking if warehouse candidates exist. If no candidate is found, the item goes to \"Not Found.\" If a candidate is present, the process then checks for a match based on the seven categories. If a match is found, further attributes are checked. If a match is confirmed, it moves to \"Confirmed Match\". If no match is found, the agent must review. If review is required, the item moves to the \"Review\" sheet, otherwise it moves to \"Not Found\".\n\n\nCandidate items are initially searched using a normalized brand and TF-IDF/n-gram based method to find the top six candidates. If no candidates pass the score threshold in the current warehouse, a search across all warehouses is conducted. If no candidate is found across all warehouses, the item is marked as \"Not Found.\"\n\nThe system proceeds to an exact match check after candidate selection. Normalization, including diacritic removal, hamza normalization, and whitespace trimming, is performed. A confirmed match is made if the normalized item name exactly matches an item in the warehouse catalog.\n\nDeterministic auto-match rules (Level 2) are then evaluated for the top candidate. This involves a series of pharmaceutical safety checks, including brand family traps, brand identity matching, dosage form compatibility, combination/modifier checks, and strength/volume verification. A mismatch at any of these safety gates prevents auto-matching, and the process advances to Level 3.\n\n\nNumeric concentrations are compared; differences trigger review. If concentrations match, packaging variations like pack size, strip count, bulk packaging, company suffixes, and price declarations are disregarded, resulting in an auto-match.\n\nLevel 3 processing uses the top five candidates for AI evaluation. The AI determines if the status is \"match,\" \"review,\" or \"no_match.\" A \"no_match\" triggers the safety net. Real brand connections without contradiction are flagged for review.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":true,\"Summary\":\"Decision Architecture Diagram for Pharmacy Drug Matching across the 3 Levels with detailed clinical gates.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# مخطط شجرة القرار الهندسية لمطابقة الأدوية (Decision Graph)\\n\\nيوضح هذا المستند المسار الكامل الذي يمر به أي صنف مطلوب (من كشف النواقص) أمام أصناف المخازن الستة للوصول إلى النتيجة الصحيحة: **(مطابقة مؤكدة - يحتاج مراجعة - لم يُعثر عليه)**.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. المخطط الانسيابي الشامل (Mermaid Flowchart)\\n\\n```mermaid\\nflowchart TD\\n    Start([\\\"📥 صنف مطلوب من كشف النواقص\\\"]) --> Search[\\\"🔍 البحث عن أفضل 5-6 مرشحين بالمخزن\\\"]\\n    \\n    Search --> HasCandidates{\\\"هل يوجد مرشحون بنسبة شبه أولية؟\\\"}\\n    HasCandidates -- \\\"لا (0 مرشحين في كل المخازن)\\\" --> SheetNotFound[\\\"❌ ورقة: لم يُعثر عليه\\\"]\\n    HasCandidates -- \\\"نعم\\\" --> ExactCheck{\\\"هل الاسم متطابق نصياً 100% بعد التنظيف؟\\\"}\\n    \\n    %% Level 1: Exact Match\\n    ExactCheck -- \\\"نعم متطابق تاماً\\\" --> ExactMatch[\\\"✅ مطابقة مؤكدة (تطابق نصي تام 100%)\\\"]\\n    ExactCheck -- \\\"لا\\\" --> Gate2_BrandFamily{\\\"فحص عائلات البراندات الكبرى\\\\n(إنسولين / بيتادين / هيرو / ليمتلس)\\\"}\\n    \\n    %% Level 2: Deterministic Gates\\n    subgraph Level2 [\\\"المستوى الثاني: المطابقة التلقائية الحتمية (Level 2 Auto-Match)\\\"]\\n        Gate2_BrandFamily -- \\\"عائلة براند والاسم الثانوي مختلف\\\\n(مثال: نوفورابيد vs أكترابيد)\\\" --> Level3_AI\\n        Gate2_BrandFamily -- \\\"اسم عادي أو نفس النوع الدقيق\\\" --> Gate2_BrandMatch{\\\"تطابق اسم البراند الأساسي؟\\\\n(بدون اختلاف حروف في الكلمات المفردة)\\\"}\\n        \\n        Gate2_BrandMatch -- \\\"اختلاف حروف بالاسم\\\\n(مثال: سينوبريت vs سينوبر\n<truncated 5313 bytes>","Description":"\"Detailed Decision Tree Diagram for 3-Level Matching\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\kakak\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a\\\\decision_architecture.md\"","toolAction":"\"Create decision tree artifact\"","toolSummary":"\"Decision tree architecture markdown\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
